  Everything else :  ~2.4 mW  ( 9%)

==============================================================================
Energy per AES Block
==============================================================================
  AES-256 rounds (14 rounds × 4 CA stages) = 56 clock cycles per block
  At 300 MHz → 56 / 300e6 = 186.7 ns per 128-bit block
  Dynamic power during AES = ~24.2 mW (active AES + CPU + fabric)
  Energy per block ≈ 24.2e-3 W × 186.7e-9 s ≈ 4.52 nJ/block
  Throughput = 128 bit / 186.7 ns ≈ 685.6 Mb/s → ~85.7 MB/s (AES alone)
  System throughput with PDF overhead ≈ 285 MB/s (pipelined streaming)

==============================================================================
TRNG Power (rosc_trng)
==============================================================================
  TRNG core power   : 620.6 µW
  At 23 Mb/s output : 620.6e-6 / 23e6 ≈ 27.0 pJ/bit
  [Comparable to ISSCC 2023 RO-TRNG: 23 pJ/b — within expected range]

